From bdc3a8489279c0ecd9e113ab55aa7ae814b7f7a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:41:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] Flash Next DFlash2: each stream verifies its own draft
 count

Several rows of a drafter round keep the full verify layout, and the expert
layers run only on the columns in use (gathered, computed, scattered back).
The round takes drafts best first by expected kept tokens and picks the count
with the best expected tokens per cost. Replaces the shared narrow window for
several rows, with its narrow record views and uncaptured accept and commit.
Adds a round timer by row count to the exit statistics.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
